# Allowed host values: exact URLs that may stay in tracked files.
#
# scripts/scan.sh applies this list after the deny lists
# (scripts/host-values.deny and the untracked .local/host-values.deny). It
# drops a deny-list finding when the line contains the pattern only inside
# one of these URLs. The same pattern in other text of the line is still a
# finding. The list hides no secret finding, no policy finding and no finding
# of scripts/host-values.regex (docs/secret-handling.md).
#
# The list holds no URL now. Add a line only after a decision of the
# maintainer.
#
# Format: one exact https URL for each line, case-sensitive. A line that
# starts with "#" is a comment. Quotes, backslashes and blanks are not allowed.
